    <panel_attributes>title=SD7 - Teach the agent a preference (F09 / UC09 - long-term memory)
obj=Student~s ACTOR
obj=:MainWindow~w
obj=:MainController~c
obj=:PlannerFacade~f
obj=:Agent~a
obj=llm:LlmClient~llm
obj=remember:RememberPreferenceTool~rp
obj=:Workspace~ws
obj=:JsonStorage~st
s-&gt;&gt;&gt;w : I never study after 10pm
w-&gt;&gt;&gt;c : onSend(message)
c-&gt;&gt;&gt;f : chat(message)
f-&gt;&gt;&gt;a : handle(message, workspace)
a-&gt;&gt;&gt;llm : complete(request)
llm.&gt;a : step remember_preference, rule NO_WORK_AFTER, value 22h00
a-&gt;&gt;&gt;rp : run(args, workspace)
combinedFragment=alt~a1 a ws
a:[known rule and a valid time]
rp-&gt;&gt;&gt;ws : addPreference(preference)
rp.&gt;a : ToolResult ok, saved
..=a1
a:[unknown rule or a bad time such as 25h00]
rp.&gt;a : ToolResult error, the time must be 00h00 to 23h59
--=a1
a-&gt;&gt;&gt;llm : complete(request)
llm.&gt;a : final answer - Got it, no study after 10pm
a.&gt;f : AgentReply
f-&gt;&gt;&gt;f + : changed("preference saved")
f-&gt;&gt;&gt;st : save(workspace)
f.&gt;c : reply
c-&gt;&gt;&gt;w : showChat(text)
ref=f ws : later, Scheduler.fits() reads getPreferences() - see SD3</panel_attributes>
